\jclisttab\tx360\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls21\adjustright\rin0\lin360\itap0 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid11340208 \'darok z ome\'9akania vo v\'fd\'9ake 0,2% z dl\'9enej \'e8iastky za ka\'9ed\'fd de\'f2 ome\'9akania spl\'e1tky v 1. a
