\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \lang1051\langfe1029\langfenp1029 \hich\af0\dbch\af0\loch\f0 3.\tab}V od\'f4vodnen\'fdch pr\'edpadoch hodn\'fdch zrete\'bea, kupuj\'faci m\'f4\'9ee po\'9eiada\'9d p\'edsomne o odklad spl\'e1
